POST {{baseUrl}}/character-drug
Authorization: {{userAuth}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "character": {
    "id": {{createdCharacterId}}
  },
  "drug": {
    "id": {{createdDrugId}}
  },
  "quantity": 12
}

### Get created character-drug row
GET {{baseUrl}}/character-drug/{{createdCharacterDrugId}}
Authorization: {{userAuth}}

### Update created character-drug row
